msgstr "شعار رؤية السعودية 2030"

msgid "SAUDI VISION 2030"
msgstr "رؤية السعودية 2030"

msgid "FROM THE KINGDOM TO THE WORLD"
msgstr "من المملكة إلى العالمية"

msgid "Guided by Saudi Vision 2030, the Kingdom is strengthening its position in esports by empowering local talent, developing the gaming industry, and hosting world-class competitions."
